# Series B Product Strategy

## Market Focus
- Mid-market operations
  - 200 to 2000 seats
- Freight and logistics
- EU and UK first

## Product Bets
- Approval workflow
  - Cycle time down 40%
- Explainable automation
- Mobile approvals

## Go to Market
- Partner-led motion
  - Systems integrators
- Usage-based packaging
- Self-serve trial

## Moat
- Proprietary routing data
  - Three years of lanes
- Integration depth
- Switching cost

## Team and Ops
- Two platform engineers
  - Hire by Q3
- Follow-the-sun support
- On-call rotation

## Success Measures
- Net revenue retention
  - 120% by year end
- Weekly active teams
- Payback under 12 months
